<h4 id=3D"get-keyword-type-group-information">Get Keyword Type Group Inform=
ation</h4>
<p>Using the list of Keyword Type Group Ids from making a GET request on <c=
ode>/document-types/{documentTypeId}/keyword-type-groups</code>, make a GET=
